        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00311:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "Deoxyribonucleic acid's space-filling and wire-frame model. Its height distance of one complete turn is thirty-four Angstrom. Major and minor grooves measure twelve and six Angstroms, respectively. Diameter is twenty Angstrom."
